h **\"Cam kết thay đổi\"**\n\n---\n\n**Copy code xong chưa?** Copy xong → dán vào GitHub → bấm \"Cam kết thay đổi\" → báo mình **\"xong rồi\"** nhé!\n\nXong bước này là có web rồi, mình chỉ bạn đưa lên Netlify lấy link gửi khách ngay 🚀"])</script><script nonce="OWVhMGQ1ZWUtY2MxMC00ZWZkLTllYjItYTJjZDYzMmZiYTVh">self.__next_f.push([1,"18f:T2e50,"])</script><script nonce="OWVhMGQ1ZWUtY2MxMC00ZWZkLTllYjItYTJjZDYzMmZiYTVh">self.__next_f.push([1,"Ok, không bấm link được thì mình **dán thẳng code ra đây** luôn. Bạn chỉ việc copy-paste:\r\n\r\n### **BƯỚC 1 - Copy code bên dưới:**\r\n\r\nBấm **3 lần chuột** vào ô code để bôi đen hết → **Ctrl + C**\r\n\r\n```html\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"vi\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n    \u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\n    \u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"\u003e\n    \u003ctitle\u003eDubViet-SaaS - Lồng tiếng AI cho Video\u003c/title\u003e\n    \u003cscript src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\n    \u003clink href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700;800\u0026display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"\u003e\n    \u003cstyle\u003e\n        body { font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro', sans-serif; }\n        .gradient-text { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }\n        .hero-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); }\n    \u003c/style\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody class=\"bg-gray-50\"\u003e\n    \u003c!-- Header --\u003e\n    \u003cheader class=\"bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4\"\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex justify-between items-center\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\n                    \u003csvg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-purple-600\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\u003e\n                        \u003cpath d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z\"/\u003e\n                    \u003c/svg\u003e\n                    \u003cspan class=\"text-2xl font-bold gradient-text\"\u003eDubViet-SaaS\u003c/span\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"flex gap-3\"\u003e\n                    \u003cbutton class=\"px-4 py-2 text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-purple-600\"\u003eĐăng nhập\u003c/button\u003e\n                    \u003cbutton class=\"px-6 py-2 bg-purple-600 text-white rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-purple-700\"\u003eDùng thử miễn phí\u003c/button\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/header\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Hero Section --\u003e\n    \u003csection class=\"hero-bg text-white py-20\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"\u003e\n            \u003ch1 class=\"text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6\"\u003eLồng tiếng Video bằng AI\u003cbr\u003eNhanh gấp 10 lần\u003c/h1\u003e\n            \u003cp class=\"text-xl mb-8 text-purple-100\"\u003eTải video lên → Chọn giọng → Tải về. Giọng Việt tự nhiên, cảm xúc như người thật.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"flex gap-4 justify-center\"\u003e\n                \u003cbutton class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white text-purple-600 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100\"\u003eBắt đầu miễn phí\u003c/button\u003e\n                \u003cbutton class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-purple-700 text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-purple-800 border-2 border-white\"\u003eXem Demo\u003c/button\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cp class=\"mt-6 text-sm text-purple-200\"\u003eKhông cần thẻ tín dụng • 5 phút video miễn phí\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/section\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Features --\u003e\n    \u003csection class=\"py-20 bg-white\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"\u003e\n            \u003ch2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16\"\u003eTính năng nổi bật\u003c/h2\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"text-center p-6\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"\u003e\n                        \u003csvg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-purple-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\u003e\u003cpath stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\"\u003eXử lý siêu tốc\u003c/h3\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"text-gray-600\"\u003eVideo 10 phút lồng tiếng xong trong 30 giây. Nhanh gấp 20 lần làm thủ công.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"text-center p-6\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"\u003e\n                        \u003csvg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-purple-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\u003e\u003cpath stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 01-3-3V5a3 3 0 116 0v6a3 3 0 01-3 3z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\"\u003e50+ Giọng Việt\u003c/h3\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"text-gray-600\"\u003eNam/Nữ, Bắc/Trung/Nam. Có cảm xúc vui, buồn, thuyết minh, quảng cáo.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"text-center p-6\"\u003e\n                    \u003cdiv class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-purple-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"\u003e\n                        \u003csvg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-purple-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\u003e\u003cpath stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\n                    \u003c/div\u003e\n                    \u003ch3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\"\u003eGiữ nguyên nhạc nền\u003c/h3\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"text-gray-600\"\u003eAI tách giọng gốc, giữ nhạc + hiệu ứng. Video xuất ra chuyên nghiệp.\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \u003c/div\u003e\n    \u003c/section\u003e\n\n    \u003c!-- Pricing --\u003e\n    \u003csection class=\"py-20 bg-gray-50\"\u003e\n        \u003cdiv class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"\u003e\n            \u003ch2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4\"\u003eBảng giá đơn giản\u003c/h2\u003e\n            \u003cp class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-16\"\u003eTrả theo phút video. Không phí ẩn.\u003c/p\u003e\n            \u003cdiv class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto\"\u003e\n                \u003cdiv class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg\"\u003e\n                    \u003ch3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-2\"\u003eMiễn phí\u003c/h3\u003e\n                    \u003cp class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-6\"\u003e0đ\u003c/p\u003e\n                    \u003cul class=\"space-y-3 mb-8\"\u003e\n                        \u003cli class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-green-500\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"\u003e\u003cpath fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e5 phút video/thá