                          [Tên Space mới]  ← Click vào đây gõ tên</code></pre></div></div></div></div><script nonce="OWVhMGQ1ZWUtY2MxMC00ZWZkLTllYjItYTJjZDYzMmZiYTVh">$RC("B:20","S:20")</script><div hidden id="S:21"><div><div class="ur-code-block"><div class="ur-code-block__header"><div class="ur-code-block__header-left"><span class="ur-code-block__metadata">Code</span></div><div class="ur-code-block__header-right"></div></div><div class="ur-code-block__content"><pre><code>Đăng ký PRO tại https://huggingface.co/subscribe/pro để sử dụng ZeroGPU</code></pre></div></div></div></div><script nonce="OWVhMGQ1ZWUtY2MxMC00ZWZkLTllYjItYTJjZDYzMmZiYTVh">$RC("B:21","S:21")</script><div hidden id="S:22"><div><div class="ur-code-block"><div class="ur-code-block__header"><div class="ur-code-block__header-left"><span class="ur-code-block__metadata">Code</span></div><div class="ur-code-block__header-right"></div></div><div class="ur-code-block__content"><pre><code>gradio==4.36.1
